@startuml
title Export
start
:Open the command menu and choose an export;
:The bottom line asks where to write the file;
if (what should the file hold?) then (picture and source)
  :SVG or PNG keeps the source inside;
  :Drop that file on the window to open the source again;
elseif (a photo) then (JPEG)
  :JPEG is the picture only;
elseif (a document) then (PDF)
  :PDF carries the picture, the source and the SVG;
elseif (a page) then (Markdown)
  :Markdown is the diagram as a page;
else (a bundle)
  :ZIP holds the SVG, the source and the PDF;
endif
stop
@enduml
